    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the creators of Synth Riders comes <strong>FINAL FURY</strong>, a VR fighting game that redefines stepping into the ring. Face off against the galaxy\u2019s fiercest fighters\u2014offline or across the world with rollback netcode. This isn\u2019t some button-pushing battle. Every punch, every block, and every special attack is powered by YOU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FINAL FURY</strong> is more than a fighting game\u2014this is a<strong> VR</strong> fighting game done right, with the support from the nine-time EVO champion Justin Wong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200e\u3164</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/9d566eb6e1763e2f6c360f7023ba0816.poster.avif?t=1750196515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/9d566eb6e1763e2f6c360f7023ba0816.webm?t=1750196515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/7bbcf2cb17e50262c8d7757e9ea992fa.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Feel like a fighter</strong> as YOU step into the arena. It\u2019s a first-person throw-down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Innovative VR combat</strong>, blends classic fighting mechanics with physical gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Six characters and counting</strong>, each with unique moves to match your play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Advised by Justin Wong</strong> and inspired by arcade legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Arcade Mode</strong> with challenging AI and unlockable rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Compete Online</strong> with cross-platform play and rollback netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Heart-pumping OST</strong> composed by Zardonic (SUPERHOT: Mind Control Delete).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Break a Sweat</strong> while delivering a beatdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/62d1b84975d2923daa09e15d7910965b.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/f5a553b68100d324a83c1e21dee2ac0a.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FINAL FURY</strong> isn\u2019t just about picking a fighter and learning their moves\u2014BECOME the fighter! Feel the adrenaline as you unleash your FINAL FURY in immersive VR battles where you are the hero. Whether you\u2019re rushing down, footsie-ing, or action-canceling your way to victory, <strong>FINAL FURY</strong>\u2019s skill curve is easy to pick up and tough to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/116ae908672bf5fc87aff3e725974675.poster.avif?t=1750196515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/116ae908672bf5fc87aff3e725974675.webm?t=1750196515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/83155364f2e2fad6896553ea644bff1e.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fierce fights while coming to blows in first person, then get pumped as ground-pounding finishers and grapples unfold in cinematic third-person perspective cuts. All this explodes around you while battling to the adrenaline-soaked soundtrack from Zardonic (SUPERHOT: MIND CONTROL DELETE)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/3d62f0a137c7990d5a6db285f77668a9.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the official<strong> FINAL FURY</strong> Discord to learn more about community tournaments, the latest FINAL FURY news, and insights straight from the dev team! This fight\u2019s just getting started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/4b3d440b3a6e4bb311cf6c5c6abb28c0.webp?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the creators of Synth Riders comes <strong>FINAL FURY</strong>, a VR fighting game that redefines stepping into the ring. Face off against the galaxy\u2019s fiercest fighters\u2014offline or across the world with rollback netcode. This isn\u2019t some button-pushing battle. Every punch, every block, and every special attack is powered by YOU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FINAL FURY</strong> is more than a fighting game\u2014this is a<strong> VR</strong> fighting game done right, with the support from the nine-time EVO champion Justin Wong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200e\u3164</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/9d566eb6e1763e2f6c360f7023ba0816.poster.avif?t=1750196515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/9d566eb6e1763e2f6c360f7023ba0816.webm?t=1750196515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/7bbcf2cb17e50262c8d7757e9ea992fa.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Feel like a fighter</strong> as YOU step into the arena. It\u2019s a first-person throw-down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Innovative VR combat</strong>, blends classic fighting mechanics with physical gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Six characters and counting</strong>, each with unique moves to match your play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Advised by Justin Wong</strong> and inspired by arcade legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Arcade Mode</strong> with challenging AI and unlockable rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Compete Online</strong> with cross-platform play and rollback netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Heart-pumping OST</strong> composed by Zardonic (SUPERHOT: Mind Control Delete).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Break a Sweat</strong> while delivering a beatdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/62d1b84975d2923daa09e15d7910965b.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/f5a553b68100d324a83c1e21dee2ac0a.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FINAL FURY</strong> isn\u2019t just about picking a fighter and learning their moves\u2014BECOME the fighter! Feel the adrenaline as you unleash your FINAL FURY in immersive VR battles where you are the hero. Whether you\u2019re rushing down, footsie-ing, or action-canceling your way to victory, <strong>FINAL FURY</strong>\u2019s skill curve is easy to pick up and tough to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/116ae908672bf5fc87aff3e725974675.poster.avif?t=1750196515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/116ae908672bf5fc87aff3e725974675.webm?t=1750196515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/83155364f2e2fad6896553ea644bff1e.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fierce fights while coming to blows in first person, then get pumped as ground-pounding finishers and grapples unfold in cinematic third-person perspective cuts. All this explodes around you while battling to the adrenaline-soaked soundtrack from Zardonic (SUPERHOT: MIND CONTROL DELETE)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/3d62f0a137c7990d5a6db285f77668a9.avif?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the official<strong> FINAL FURY</strong> Discord to learn more about community tournaments, the latest FINAL FURY news, and insights straight from the dev team! This fight\u2019s just getting started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/4b3d440b3a6e4bb311cf6c5c6abb28c0.webp?t=1750196515\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
